# The build context was 4.9 GB without this, which is not a performance note:
# it filled the Docker disk and the build died before it reached a single
# instruction. Everything below is either rebuilt inside the image or has no
# business being in it.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
.turbo
**/.turbo
# `**/` is load-bearing. Docker's ignore patterns anchor at the context root, so
# a bare `*.tsbuildinfo` misses every nested one — and a stale incremental cache
# from the host is worse than no cache: tsc reads it, believes the outputs are
# current, emits four of six modules and exits 0. The image then fails to build
# on a missing export that exists in the source.
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github

# Secrets never enter an image, not even a layer that is later discarded.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local-only working notes and the operator's uploaded media.
docs-local
media

.DS_Store
*.log
coverage
